  <LocalizationPair Name="%StarSystemImprovementUniqueCurioInvasionManpowerDescription">Using liquid composites in plating has allowed us to not only make somewhat more effective armor, but also perform wargames using modified kinetic munitions; mass high-quality training becomes widespread, at the expense of mass bruising.</LocalizationPair>
